<div class="maincont biosection" style="padding-top: 50px;padding-bottom: 250px">
    <div>
        <h2 id="im-mike"style="text-align:center">I'm Mike</h2>
        <hr style="margin-bottom:0px; margin-top: 0px">
        <p>I like to cook stuff and then tell other people how I cook it. My food has been described as "really good" by my girlfriend and "inedible" by no one, so basically you should trust what I say about cooking. I have zero Michelin stars, but I have cooked for money. I've been cooking for over a decade, and I'm happy to share what I know with you.</p>
        <div style="text-align:center">
            <button onclick="location.href='/about'" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; width:fit-content; padding:20px">More about me</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="place-items: center;">
        <img id="mike-portrait" src="/images/selfportrait.png">
    </div>
</div>

